Spill Liability Trust Fund rate, are appropriated to the fund.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 422, 1494, 575], \"page_id\": 124}], \"content\": \"Certain amounts were transferred from other funds and were appropriated to the Oil Spill Liability Trust Fund as provided by 26 United States Code 9509(b). Certain paid penalties and amounts recovered for damages are also appropriated to the fund.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 575, 1494, 700], \"page_id\": 124}], \"content\": \"Amounts in the fund are available for oil spill cleanup costs and certain other related purposes as provided by appropriations acts or section 6002(b) of the Oil Pollution Act of 1990 (Public Law 101-380).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1372, 1989, 1494, 2018], \"page_id\": 124}], \"content\": \"March 2021\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1444, 97, 1488, 132], \"page_id\": 125}], \"content\": \"119\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [499, 240, 1142, 314], \"page_id\": 125}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-12.\\u2014Oil Spill Liability Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal Year 2020\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [581, 325, 1058, 351], \"page_id\": 125}], \"content\": \"[Source: Bureau of the Fiscal Service, Funds Management Branch]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [149, 358, 1483, 1193], \"page_id\": 125}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Balance Oct. 1, 2019</td><td>$6,819,211,498</td></tr><tr><td>Revenue:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Drawback claims</td><td>-59,771,902</td></tr><tr><td>Return of Funds\\u2014DOT</td><td>1,630,890</td></tr><tr><td>Return of Funds\\u2014USCG</td><td>248,241</td></tr><tr><td>Cost recoveries</td><