{\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [317, 196, 1317, 238], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Agriculture Disaster Relief Trust Fund\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 250, 803, 561], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"The Food, Conservation, and Energy Act of 2008, P.L. 110-246, authorized the implementation of the Supplemental Agricultural Disaster Assistance Program under Sections 12033 and 15001. The Taxpayer Relief Act of 2012 provided authority for discretionary funds to be used to execute several of the disaster programs for fiscal year 2013, but no funds were appropriated. Using funds from the Agricultural Disaster Relief Trust Fund, established under section 902 of the Trade Act of 1974, the program is administered by the USDA Farm Service Agency (FSA).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [135, 559, 807, 745], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"Funds from the Agricultural Disaster Relief Trust Fund were used to make payments to farmers and ranchers under the following five disaster assistance programs: Supplemental Revenue Assistance Payments (SURE) Program; Livestock Forage Disaster Program (LFP); Livestock Indemnity Program (LIP); Tree Assistance\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [829, 252, 1495, 316], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"Program (TAP); and Emergency Assistance for Livestock, Honey Bees, and Farm-Raised Fish (ELAP) Program.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [829, 316, 1497, 587], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"Fiscal Year 2020 obligations, including adjustments to prior year obligations, totaled $45,040. Total net outlays were $88,400 including outlays from prior year obligations, as shown in the table below. In 2020, the amount of customs receipts credited to the Agricultural Disaster Relief Trust Fund receipt account totaled $38,220. The outlays reported in fiscal year 2020 are due to residual payments, corrections, and/or appeals to obligations incurred for crop years 2008 \\u2013 2011.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 589, 1495, 717], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"The Agriculture Act of 2014 shifted the funding authority for disaster programs from the Agricultural Disaster Relief Trust Fund to USDA's Commodity Credit Corporation.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [428, 917, 1222, 999], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"TABLE TF-15.\\u2014Agriculture Disaster Relief Trust Fund Results of Operations, Fiscal Year 2020\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [607, 999, 1036, 1030], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"[In thousands of dollars. Source: Department of Agriculture]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [148, 1040, 1497, 1662], \"page_id\": 129}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Cumulative debt, start of year 2020</td><td>$2,609,971</td></tr><tr><td>Borrowing authority</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Repayment of debt</td><td>-108</td></tr><tr><td>Cumulative debt, end of year</td><td>2,609,863</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\">Budgetary resources:</td></tr><tr><td>Borrowing Authority</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Mandatory appropriation</td><td>38</td></tr><tr><td>Other offsetting collections</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Total budgetary resources</td><td>14,581</td></tr><tr><td>Obligated balance, Oct. 1, 2019</td><td>46</td></tr><tr><td>Fiscal Year 2020 obligations</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"2\\\">Outlays:</td></tr><tr><td>Supplemental Revenue Assistance Payments Program</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Livestock Forage Disaster Program</td><td>80</td></tr><tr><td>Livestock Indemnity Program</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Tree Assistance Program</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Emergency Assistance of Live